challenge at the end of the month.' Corrected the ARC-AGI-3 Submission Sprint Forcing Function retirement
in CLAUDE.md + the known-issues entry: retires on 2026-06-30 (challenge deadline) OR operator lifts it --
NOT when submissions are made. The priority continues (keep solving + improving across every submission)
through the deadline. Memory updated.

